        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "70467625-9037-390e-ae1b-965c71ac8e3c",
                "word": "ouvre-porte",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                        "entry_id": "70467625-9037-390e-ae1b-965c71ac8e3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dispositif permettant de débloquer ou d’ouvrir un porte à distance, souvent combiné à un interphone ou parlophone, ou à une télécommande."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38162606-e66c-438c-93e2-2932cab25efd",
                                "sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                                "text": "Quand un occupant appuie sur le bouton de commande de l’ouvre-porte, il ferme le circuit, L’électro-aimant attire alors son armature, donc le pêne, qui libère la porte et celle-ci s’ouvre sous simple pression de la main."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b780568-87d3-4d96-abc9-bf68bfe0f7c9",
                                "sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                                "text": "Aujourd’hui plutôt que de frapper à la porte, on sonne, on s’annonce par l’interphone, on se fait ouvrir par l’ouvre-porte, on compose un code d’ouverture..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b12aaf0-c2ee-4df5-8f88-794508bce0f4",
                                "sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                                "text": "Les ouvre-portes motorisés doivent obligatoirement être dotés d’un mécanisme de sécurité qui déclenche automatiquement la réouverture de la porte si un enfant vient à passer sous la porte au moment de sa fermeture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af505168-20eb-4493-a621-9183027b26e2",
                                "sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                                "text": "Sans le savoir, mes voisins m’approvisionnent en appareils de toutes sortes : vieilles radios, magnétophones, fers à frise et télécommandes d’ouvre-porte de garage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aebec94d-4e1d-4262-bbe6-a90fe7a2ae93",
                        "source_entry_id": "70467625-9037-390e-ae1b-965c71ac8e3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "Türöffner",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Türöffner",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a12ea85-535b-3b53-ac01-e1d3483df476",
                                        "entry_id": "624e4b2a-ff7d-3e08-b891-939a861f48d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "elektrisch betriebene Anlage, mit der man von einem entfernten Ort aus eine Tür öffnen kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8939edac-f634-49b2-ade1-572af6ecca5c",
                                                "sense_id": "1a12ea85-535b-3b53-ac01-e1d3483df476",
                                                "text": "„Er räumte seine Sachen dort ein und erschrak plötzlich, als das laute Schnarren des Türöffners an sein Ohr drang.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50210aae-a406-400f-b047-752748e8e55d",
                                                "sense_id": "1a12ea85-535b-3b53-ac01-e1d3483df476",
                                                "text": "„Eine raue Stimme antwortete, und der Türöffner summte, nachdem Elma und Sævar sich vorgestellt hatten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55d969cf-fd5a-40e5-85bc-d589abbdd290",
                        "source_entry_id": "70467625-9037-390e-ae1b-965c71ac8e3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9c2aba3-b991-39c0-a6d2-28dfe41273c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "door opener",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "door opener",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc842ff0-6449-3cff-b697-4fcb84bdad3d",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The control mechanism by which a door is latched and unlatched."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69a7ff58-524e-4efe-bc31-6ed9e7b198f8",
                                                "sense_id": "cc842ff0-6449-3cff-b697-4fcb84bdad3d",
                                                "text": "Last, door systems are examined, particularly locking and latching mechanisms, door openers and door closers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e10ae56d-57c4-4dec-893c-bcc79bac11f6",
                                                "sense_id": "cc842ff0-6449-3cff-b697-4fcb84bdad3d",
                                                "text": "[…] the rack being engaged by a meshing door opening and/or closing pinion of a door opener whereby the door is thus capable of being opened upon the door opener controlled rotation of said pinion in one direction and of being closed upon the door opener controlled rotation of such pinion in the other direction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a7fcc33-5215-4a5d-93db-6da28c1a83f5",
                                                "sense_id": "cc842ff0-6449-3cff-b697-4fcb84bdad3d",
                                                "text": "Latour's iconic example of doors and door openers helps boil down the complexity involved in the creation of any technology to a simple evocative case."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cab30f3-723f-39e7-a726-685b71e08cce",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various devices designed to make opening a door easier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09b86d1c-4792-445c-8c8c-716177015d07",
                                                "sense_id": "6cab30f3-723f-39e7-a726-685b71e08cce",
                                                "text": "Car door openers which are said to permit easy one-man operation are available. These devices consist of a light chain fall for attaching to the door handle. When door openers are used, the fixed end of the fall will not be fastened to a car ladder or grab iron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e2437bc-3e84-48f0-bb1a-a7ec93fca13f",
                                                "sense_id": "6cab30f3-723f-39e7-a726-685b71e08cce",
                                                "text": "The door openers were printed in PLA at a rate of 70–80 per day at the University of Cincinnati Digital Fabrication Laboratory across roughly 20 3D printers. The door openers were printed in batches of 3–4 per print session on each printer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff18960e-6993-37d5-819f-4aeedf59bac4",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various devices designed to make opening a door easier.",
                                            "Any of various devices to automatically open a door in response to a sensor or signal sent from a controller."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "077adc91-d0ad-4285-8468-5c0dbc31703f",
                                                "sense_id": "ff18960e-6993-37d5-819f-4aeedf59bac4",
                                                "text": "A radio control for a door opener operating above 70 MHz manufactured after March 24, 1971 shall be certificated pursuant to Subpart B of this part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdfd99d6-0a20-4ebb-a755-145ba383a8cb",
                                                "sense_id": "ff18960e-6993-37d5-819f-4aeedf59bac4",
                                                "text": "Some inspectors will not test an automatic door opener if there is a vehicle parked in the garage under the opener."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d1d4e4e-e119-4150-9633-2136ba23e836",
                                                "sense_id": "ff18960e-6993-37d5-819f-4aeedf59bac4",
                                                "text": "Another cause might be a short in the wire between the door opener and wall button, which can activate the opener at the slightest jiggle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23a66970-77b4-4874-bcdd-02d8b5571e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "ff18960e-6993-37d5-819f-4aeedf59bac4",
                                                "text": "The head-mounted door openers are usually surface-applied to the head of the door frame and operate the door with an arm assembly similar to a standard door closer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9acbd585-0715-34ba-b4d6-315061a5f1f8",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various devices designed to make opening a door easier.",
                                            "A crowbar-like tool used by firefighters to quickly force locked doors to open."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee185324-5729-4c1f-b445-9a9e24314958",
                                                "sense_id": "9acbd585-0715-34ba-b4d6-315061a5f1f8",
                                                "text": "The two most common types of door openers used are the \"Hale\" and the \"Detroit\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deb001df-d1f8-4ced-b9e9-ddd787aa4513",
                                                "sense_id": "9acbd585-0715-34ba-b4d6-315061a5f1f8",
                                                "text": "Within this one tool, you have the same basic feature of the door opener, crowbar, and hatchet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c1d8547-0954-4f6d-b901-0c61e2abe4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "9acbd585-0715-34ba-b4d6-315061a5f1f8",
                                                "text": "Although an old tool, the Detroit door opener still functions well when used correctly and will have devastating effects on today's standard locks and door closures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55303220-8c05-30af-b027-5d9a5a762199",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who opens doors."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f3ee20d-5352-4a34-b250-e3bed73498fd",
                                                "sense_id": "55303220-8c05-30af-b027-5d9a5a762199",
                                                "text": "Imagine our language type as a \"door opener.\" There are two kinds of door openers: “interpreter openers\" and \"compiler openers.\" An interpreter opener has a rough job. He must carry a large bag of keys wherever he goes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08ecb32a-74e6-44b5-87ff-c099d26d3009",
                                                "sense_id": "55303220-8c05-30af-b027-5d9a5a762199",
                                                "text": "Jody steps toward the first door, then motions for his lighting man–Mike, and his designated door opener–Wil, to flank him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a394bee3-4050-3a92-b481-e70e78645161",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any tactic, approach, or giveaway item employed by a salesman to capture the interest of a potential customer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f286868-b16d-4f39-9e70-7b0831ab8eb2",
                                                "sense_id": "a394bee3-4050-3a92-b481-e70e78645161",
                                                "text": "[…] when working the territory cold, you will find these little notes great door openers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfd4875a-2d1a-42b2-b679-febfcae5b200",
                                                "sense_id": "a394bee3-4050-3a92-b481-e70e78645161",
                                                "text": "We occasionally resort to what we call \"door openers\" to aid the salesman in obtaining an interview. One of these was a bill hook, a very useful little device, for hanging in the kitchen and making it convenient for the housewife […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad9b6079-fba7-4540-bc4e-3e715dfef7d8",
                                                "sense_id": "a394bee3-4050-3a92-b481-e70e78645161",
                                                "text": "[…] admitted that the salesmen are all door-to-door sales people […] and that many of them […] used different statements as door-openers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcb95528-7b6b-3d28-aaaf-d24080a22961",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A communication technique designed to encourage someone to speak openly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80a1c06c-9fbb-4ddf-a536-f850293b622d",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb95528-7b6b-3d28-aaaf-d24080a22961",
                                                "text": "Sincerity is key to the effectiveness of nonverbal door openers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d48d68d2-7288-43ac-9d54-caf3b08083d9",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb95528-7b6b-3d28-aaaf-d24080a22961",
                                                "text": "The therapeutic interviewer can use a door opener to start to explore a particular client concern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "187a3b5d-e40e-4011-8fee-dfc131381a4e",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb95528-7b6b-3d28-aaaf-d24080a22961",
                                                "text": "Door-openers are like green lights for motorists. They are signals that listeners use to encourage speakers to elaborate on their message."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d388b062-a260-4f7d-8d15-09315ce37580",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb95528-7b6b-3d28-aaaf-d24080a22961",
                                                "text": "One important listening skill to have when communicating with your child is being certain to use “door openers,” as opposed to “door slammers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa35a396-1d43-31b1-9a08-f5ee1a73fc00",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5dcb0a-61a0-3b52-b3fb-2bfac35bfb44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that provides someone with opportunities that would otherwise be unavailable to them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf24523f-07ec-48b8-9d7f-e7d547d0af3f",
                                                "sense_id": "aa35a396-1d43-31b1-9a08-f5ee1a73fc00",
                                                "text": "There are so many things that we experience that could be door openers for demons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ecb1f1f-9d20-4f04-9a2b-0235a51702a7",
                                                "sense_id": "aa35a396-1d43-31b1-9a08-f5ee1a73fc00",
                                                "text": "The story of the mutual 'door-openers,' then, depicts the act of one agent sneaking the other agent into the room behind the door as though the term that opens the door could be used – like the Trojan horse – strictly instrumentally: diversity only opens the door or functions as a container, and in comes gender, or equality or antidiscrimination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0acfdf86-bb7a-44c4-9c51-9986fd6b60ec",
                                                "sense_id": "aa35a396-1d43-31b1-9a08-f5ee1a73fc00",
                                                "text": "Door openers are social mobilizers and bridges, introducing or integrating young people into their own networks and groups, extending their social capital and connections to provide new social, cultural, and economic benefits. Those born into wealthy families may inherit powerful door openers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
